c-plc/alabama/wilcox-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, April to May came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 162% of normal in April to May, then just 32% in August to September. Grid 14573 had its driest year in 1954 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
